<html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
<head>
<title>h1 to h6 have their font sizes, margins and bold weight</title>
<meta name="assert" content="HTML 15.3.6: h1 2em/.67em, h2 1.5em/.83em, h3 1.17em/1em, h4 1em/1.33em, h5 .83em/1.67em, h6 .67em/2.33em, all bold."/>
</head>
<body><h1>h1</h1><h2>h2</h2><h3>h3</h3><h4>h4</h4><h5>h5</h5><h6>h6</h6>
</body>
</html>
